l down</p></div></div></div><div data-v-bdd5ee4a=\"\" data-v-c957af32=\"\" class=\"webglBg heroBlock\"><div data-v-bdd5ee4a=\"\" class=\"webglBg__content heroBlock\"><div data-v-56dff9b3=\"\" data-v-c957af32=\"\" class=\"gridWrapper hasPadding heroBlock__top\"><p data-v-c957af32=\"\" class=\"top__left\">Raised&nbsp;in<br>France</p><p data-v-c957af32=\"\" class=\"top__center\">More or less successful experiences, more or less unusual hobbies and things I like to do in my free time.</p><p data-v-c957af32=\"\" class=\"top__right\">Working worlwide</p></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" data-v-c957af32=\"\" class=\"beeBlock heroBlock__bee\" infosleft=\"Raised&amp;nbsp;in&lt;br&gt;France\" infoscenter=\"More or less successful experiences, more or less unusual hobbies and things I like to do in my free time.\" infosright=\"Working worlwide\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"beeBlock__container\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"container__titles--default\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">Who is this</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(-5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">curious</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">fellow</h2></div></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"container__titles--reveal\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0%, 0%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd