anama.</p></div><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-95d29d2a=\"\" class=\"textComponent texts__text-1\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">Twenty of us from Locomotive decided to trade the beach vibes for a sunrise hike in the mountains during a one week trip to Central America.</p></div></div><p data-v-95d29d2a=\"\" class=\"introBlock__star\">*</p></div></div><div data-v-bdd5ee4a=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"webglBg flowersBlock\"><div data-v-56dff9b3=\"\" data-v-bdd5ee4a=\"\" class=\"gridWrapper hasPadding webglBg__content flowersBlock\"><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__container\"><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--1\"><p data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__paragraph line__paragraph--1\">Venturing beyond creative limits in each project and</p><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">exploring the</p></div></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--2\"><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__wrapper\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">digital</p></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__flower\"></div></div><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">frontiers.</p></div></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--3\"><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__wrapper\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">I create</p></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__flower\"></div></div><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">impactful</p></div></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--4\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">websites using a</p></div></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--5\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">mix of</p></div><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">typography</p></div></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--6\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">clean layouts</p></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__flower\"></div></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--7\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">animation and</p></div></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"flowersBlock__line flowersBlock__line--8\"><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__wrapper\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">3D</p></div><div data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__flower\"></div><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"textComponent line__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">elements</p></div></div><p data-v-245019a5=\"\" class=\"line__paragraph line__paragraph--2\">and sometimes even unexpected things, like these flowers!</p></div></div></div></div><div data-v-56dff9b3=\"\" data-v-afac87a3=\"\" class=\"gridWrapper hasPadding webglSectionBlock\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" data-v-afac87a3=\"\" class=\"cardBlock webglSectionBlock__card\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"cardBlock__top\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"top__indication\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"indication__circle\"></div> +6 years exp.</div><p data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"top__number\">(4)</p></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"cardBlock__content\"><h3 data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"content__title\">Professional experiences</h3><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"content__jobs\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"jobs__job\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__line\"></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__wrapper\"><p data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__date\">Since 2020</p><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__name\">Freelance</div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__roles\">Art Director, UI &amp; Interactive Designer.</div></div></div></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"jobs__job\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__line\"></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__wrapper\"><p data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__date\">2023 - 2026</p><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"wrapper\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__current\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"current__circle\"></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"current__text\">Current</div></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__name\">Locomotive</div></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__roles\">Art Director, UI &amp; Interactive Designer.</div></div></div></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"jobs__job\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__line\"></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__wrapper\"><p data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__date\">2021 - 2023</p><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__name\">Immersive Garden</div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__roles\">Art Director, UI &amp; Interactive Designer.</div></div></div></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"jobs__job\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__line\"></div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__wrapper\"><p data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__date\">2019 - 2021</p><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\"><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__name\">148</div><div data-v-c38c2dd3=\"\" class=\"job__roles\">Junior Art Director, UI Designer.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!----></div><div data-v-bdd5ee4a=\"\" data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"webglBg contentBlock\"><div data-v-56dff9b3=\"\" data-v-bdd5ee4a=\"\" class=\"gridWrapper hasPadding webglBg__content contentBlock\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"contentBlock__left\"><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"textComponent left__title\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">Throughout my various professional experiences, I've had the chance to work   alongside some fantastic talents.</p></div><p data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"left__star\">*</p><div data-v-40c4f0b4=\"\" data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"mediaComponent left__media\"><img data-v-40c4f0b4=\"\" class=\"mediaComponent__media\" src=\"https://cdn.leoparpeix.com/assets/medias/about/content-webp/content.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"textComponent left__text left__text---0\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">I specialize in building websites that prioritize impact.</p></div><div data-v-0a0537df=\"\" data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"textComponent left__text left__text---1\"><p data-v-0a0537df=\"\" class=\"textComponent__content\">Utilizing a blend of typography, clean layouts, animation, and 3D elements, my goal is to create engaging digital experiences that stand out.</p></div></div><div data-v-72708019=\"\" data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"parallaxComponent contentBlock__right\"><ul data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"right__recognitions\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__title\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"title__text\">Awards and recognition</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"title__number\">(31)</div></div><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">THE WEBBY AWARDS</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">1</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">AWWWARDS SOTM</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">1</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">AWWWARDS SOTD</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">10</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">AWWWARDS NOMINEE SOTM</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">4</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">FWA SOTM</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">1</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">FWA SOTD</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">5</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">CSSDA SOTM</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">2</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">CSSDA SOTD</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">4</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">Maxi best of</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\">3</div></li><li data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"recognitions__award\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__name\">Jitter Hackathon winner 2025</div><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"award__number\"></div></li></ul><ul data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"right__clients\"><div data-v-ce774f65=\"\" class=\"clients_