ation,were, for sure, one of the key elements,in the success of this portfolio.,And, a big shout-out to &lt;a target='_blank' class='text__link' href='https://www.instagram.com/vic.rou'&gt;Victor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a target='_blank' class='text__link' href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/felix-sikora/'&gt;Félix&lt;/a&gt;,and &lt;a target='_blank' class='text__link' href='https://www.instagram.com/lucas_gssr/'&gt;Lucas&lt;/a&gt; for their patience and 3D,crazy skills !\" bigtexts=\"My goal was to strike the right balance between an immersive 3D experience and a clean 2D environment, allowing visitors to explore my projects in a single scroll and understand my skill set in under 10 seconds.,I built the concept around the moustache daisy, a symbol that reflects both my personality and my creative approach. As the experience unfolds, you'll discover a character meticulously sculpted in an artist's workshop, one that exudes the beauty of nature, or one that becomes a strange and playful magical object.\" credits=\"[object Object]\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"beeBlock__container\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"container__titles--default\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">Let's create</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(-5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">a remarkable</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title\">journey</h2></div></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"container__titles--reveal\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0%, 0%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title title--1\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\">your gateway</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0%, 0%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title title--2\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(-5%, 100%, 0px);\">to excitement</h2></div></div><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"titles__wrapper\"><div data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0%, 0%, 0px);\"><h2 data-v-fbfd32ba=\"\" class=\"title title--3\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(5%, 100%, 0px);\">starts here !</h2></div></div></div></div><!----></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"footerBlock__bottom\"><button data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"bottom__credits\" style=\"pointer-events: auto; cursor: pointer;\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"credits__button\" style=\"\">Credits</div></button><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"bottom__networks\"><a data-v-3d08a041=\"\" data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"mainButton networks__link green\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/leo_parpeix\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"networks__link networks__link--email green\" data-cursor-indication-preserve=\"\"><span data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"networks__emailHit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> lparpeix@gmail.com</p><a data-v-3d08a041=\"\" data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"mainButton networks__link green\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/leo-parpeix\" target=\"_blank\">Linkedin</a></div><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"bottom__copyright\">© 2026</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"footerBlock__popup green\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__transitionWrapper--outer\" style=\"\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__transitionWrapper--inner\" style=\"\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__top\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"top__star\">*</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"top__infos\">about this Portfolio</p><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"top__cross green\" style=\"\"><svg data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"svg-cross cross__icon\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 11 11\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect y=\"5\" width=\"11\" height=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"5\" y=\"11\" width=\"11\" height=\"1\" transform=\"rotate(-90 5 11)\"></rect></svg></div></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"popup__content\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__left\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"left__content\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__textWrapper\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">A huge shout-out to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://twitter.com/LecornuThoma\">Thoma Lecornu</a>,</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">who jumped onto this project with me.</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__textWrapper\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">His personality and determination</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">were, for sure, one of the key elements</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">in the success of this portfolio.</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__textWrapper\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">And, a big shout-out to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vic.rou\">Victor</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/felix-sikora/\">Félix</a></p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"text__link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lucas_gssr/\">Lucas</a> for their patience and 3D</p><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"wrapper__text\">crazy skills !</p></div></div></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"content__right\"><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__textBlock\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__text\">My goal was to strike the right balance between an immersive 3D experience and a clean 2D environment, allowing visitors to explore my projects in a single scroll and understand my skill set in under 10 seconds.</p></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__textBlock\" style=\"opacity: 0;\"><p data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"right__text\">I built the concept around the moustache daisy, a symbol that reflects both my personality and my creative approach. As the experience unfolds, you'll discover a character meticulously sculpted in an artist's workshop, one that exudes the beauty of nature, or one that becomes a strange and playful magical object.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-063391ad=\"\" class=\"footerBlock__overlay\" style=\"opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;\"></div></div></div></div></main>",
  "text": "Léo Parpeix\nArt director, Interactive designer\n\nWorld building\n\nLéo Parpeix\nArt director, Interactive designer\nWork\nAbout\nPlayground\nDISCOVER MORE\n\nBringing depth and\npersonality to every\ncreation.\n\nScroll down\n\nRaised in\nFrance\n\nMore or less successful experiences, more or less unusual hobbies and things I like to do in my free time.\n\nWorking worlwide\n\nWHO IS THIS\nCURIOUS\nFELLOW\nCOLORBLIND\nBUT SEES\nVIBES\n(Wanna know ?)\n\nEl Valle de Antón\n\nSpring 2025\n\nLas Colinas, Panama\n\nThat's me. In the photo, I mean. Sacha took it at 5:00 AM, on a summit in the middle of Panama.\n\nTwenty of us from Locomotive decided to trade the beach vibes for a sunrise hike in the mountains during a one week trip to Central America.\n\n*\n\nVenturing beyond creative limits in each project and\n\nEXPLORING THE\n\nDIGITAL\n\nFRONTIERS.\n\nI CREATE\n\nIMPACTFUL\n\nWEBSITES USING A\n\nMIX OF\n\nTYPOGRAPHY\n\nCLEAN LAYOUTS\n\nANIMATION AND\n\n3D\n\nELEMENTS\n\nand sometimes even unexpected things, like these flowers!\n\n+6 years exp.\n\n(4)\n\nProfessional experiences\n\nSince 2020\n\nFreelance\nArt Director, UI & Interactive Designer.\n\n2023 - 2026\n\nCurrent\nLocomotive\nArt Director, UI & Interactive Designer.\n\n2021 - 2023\n\nImmersive Garden\nArt Director, UI & Interactive Designer.\n\n2019 - 2021\n\n148\nJunior Art Director, UI Designer.\n\nTHROUGHOUT MY VARIOUS PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCES, I'VE HAD THE CHANCE TO WORK ALONGSIDE SOME FANTASTIC TALENTS.\n\n*\n\nI specialize in building websites that prioritize impact.\n\nUtilizing a blend of typography, clean layouts, animation, and 3D elements, my goal is to create engaging digital experiences that stand out.\n\nAwards and recognition\n(31)\nTHE WEBBY AWARDS\n1\nAWWWARDS SOTM\n1\nAWWWARDS SOTD\n10\nAWWWARDS NOMINEE SOTM\n4\nFWA SOTM\n1\nFWA SOTD\n5\nCSSDA SOTM\n2\nCSSDA SOTD\n4\nMaxi best of\n3\nJitter Hackathon winner 2025\nClients\nPSG\nDior\nCartier\nRiot games\nTour de France\nLongines\nAir France\nMerrel\nIssey Miyake\nAriane\nOmega\nRenault\nEl Salvador\nMechachain\nUnity\nL'oréal\nJacques Marie Mage\n...\nLET'S CREATE\nA REMARKABLE\nJOURNEY\nYOUR GATEWAY\nTO EXCITEMENT\nSTARTS HERE !\nCredits\nInstagram\n\nlparpeix@gmail.com\n\nLinkedin\n\n© 2026\n\n*\n\nABOUT THIS PORTFOLIO\n\nA huge shout-out to Thoma Lecornu,\n\nwho jumped onto this project with me.\n\nHis personality and determination\n\nwere, for sure, one of the key elements\n\nin the success of this portfolio.\n\nAnd, a big shout-out to Victor, Félix\n\nand Lucas for their patience and 3D\n\ncrazy skills !\n\nMy goal was to strike the right balance between an immersive 3D experience and a clean 2D environment, allowing visitors to explore my projects in a single scroll and understand my skill set in under 10 seconds.\n\nI built the concept around the moustache daisy, a symbol that reflects both my personality and my creative approach. As the experience unfolds, you'll discover a character meticulously sculpted in an artist's workshop, one that exudes the beauty of nature, or one that becomes a strange and playful magical object.",
  "url": "https://www.leoparpeix.com/about"
}